    "body": "> I think the spec could just say that the display value of a rendered legend behaves as if its computed value was blockified.\r\n\r\nThat implies that #3955 should be revisited, no? If we're allowing table layout, it starts getting really weird to special-case disallow only a few very specific layout types.",
