    "created_at": "2018-08-30T23:37:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-30T23:37:42Z",
    "body": "Sure, I totally agree that exceptions in general _increases_ complexity **for authors**. I was only claiming that **implementing it** would be non-trivial in Gecko, so it seems reasonable to consider excluding it if there aren't any compelling uses cases.\r\n\r\nSince you can see useful use cases, I don't mind including it if other UA vendors agree to support it.",
